(text "BASE_READY = BASE_LOGIC_OK AND DRV_PG_LOGIC. The MCU sub-board provides its receiver pull-down.\nFAULT_N remains Q8 open collector with a pull-up only in the MCU 3.3 V domain. A high FAULT_N alone does not prove base power.\nU26/U27 package power and 100 nF bypass stay on Hardware PWM gates. No added logic package." (at 20.32 223.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2bea558b-6885-5df6-82c7-a07becc04f57")))
